{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>中國地震台網正式測定：09月03日19時39分在四川綿陽市北川縣（北緯31.91度，東經104.43度）發生4.8級地震，震源深度10公里。</p><figure><img alt=\"四川綿陽市北川縣發生4.8級地震。（中國地震台網）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260903/1172271862973992960150924.jpeg/23L-T5EkZJ0fNi5sAPH8cWfKG48v00Pp23FlpttxZaY\"/><figcaption>四川綿陽市北川縣發生4.8級地震。（中國地震台網）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-03T11:59:08.843399+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":96,"images":1,"source":"HK01 中國","fallback":"none"}}